{
    "background_story": "Cuddlebug, a gentle and affectionate rabbit, lived in a cozy little burrow with her partner, Fluffy. Their love story began on a sunny meadow, where they met while nibbling on fresh greens. As they spent more time together, their bond grew stronger, and they decided to tie the knot in a whimsical rabbit wedding. The ceremony was a delightful affair, with Cuddlebug looking stunning in a floral crown and Fluffy dashing in a tiny bow tie. Surrounded by friends and family, they exchanged vows and promised to love and cherish each other through thick and thin. After the wedding, Cuddlebug and Fluffy settled into a happy routine, enjoying long naps, snuggles, and quiet evenings together. Their marriage was a beautiful celebration of love, commitment, and the joy of sharing life's simple pleasures.",
